,"kind":"say","source_node_id":"3","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1029121003","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"到时候我只能对着你剩下的骸骨哭泣，只能紧紧攥着你冰冷的...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:4:1029121004:1":{"key":"say:4:1029121004:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"4","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1029121004","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"哦，我可怜的朵拉，不仅被邪恶组织蒙骗，还被魔物夺去了性命……","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:5:1029121005:1":{"key":"say:5:1029121005:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"5","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1029121005","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"等等，妈妈，我还在呢！还好好的呢，手都还是热乎的……妈...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:7:1029121006:2":{"key":"say:7:1029121006:2","kind":"say","source_node_id":"7","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1029121006","action_index":"2","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"朵拉，你竟然做出这种事，真令我失望！","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:8:1029121007:1":{"key":"say:8:1029121007:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"8","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1029121007","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"对不起，爸爸……","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:9:1029121008:1":{"key":"say:9:1029121008:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"9","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1029121008","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"你想要加入追影者就算了，结果这么长时间竟然还只是个编外...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:11:1029121009:1":{"key":"say:11:1029121009:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"11","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1029121009","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"等一下，你是不是误会了什么，追影者是个坏组织……","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:12:1029121010:2":{"key":"say:12:1029121010:2","kind":"say","source_node_id":"12","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1029121010","action_index":"2","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"我才不管什么好组织坏组织，我女儿没有的东西，别人的孩子...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:13:1029121011:1":{"key":"say:13:1029121011:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"13","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1029121011","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"快，朵拉，你快把那个追影者的基地告诉维伦先生，让他把这...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:14:1029121012:1":{"key":"say:14:1029121012:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"14","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1029121012","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"我是要清除组织没错，但不是因为这个……","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:15:1029121013:1":{"key":"say:15:1029121013:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"15","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1029121013","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"好了好了，你们都别吵了……我带维伦先生过去……","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""}},"speaker_entries":{"speaker:朵拉母亲":{"key":"speaker:朵拉母亲","source":"朵拉母亲"},"speaker:朵拉":{"key":"speaker:朵拉","source":"朵拉"},"speaker:朵拉父亲":{"key":"speaker:朵拉父亲","source":"朵拉父亲"},"speaker:维伦":{"key":"speaker:维伦","source":"维伦"}},"stats":{"source_node_count":17,"graph_node_count":14,"effect_event_count":0,"text_entry_count":13,"speaker_entry_count":4,"cast_state_line_count":13,"path_dependent_cast_state_count":0,"cinematic_count":0,"picture_count":0,"subtitle_count":0,"cinematic_dialogue_count":0}}